T1  - A DIKWP white-box semantic distributed learning approach for resource-constrained edge devices in web environments
AU  - Mei, Yingtian
AU  - Duan, Yucong
AU  - Wu, Kunguang
AU  - Li, Yingbo
JO  - International Journal of Web Information Systems
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
