T1  - Regarding general robust-feature as trigger: A transferable backdoor attack against black-box models
AU  - Wang, Jinbo
AU  - Wang, Ruijin
AU  - Zhang, Fengli
JO  - Pattern Recognition
VL  - 180
SP  - 113908
PY  - 2026
