T1  - Why hesitant help-seekers consider AI: correlations of mental health chatbot adoption among Chinese university students
AU  - Shi, Chengqi
AU  - Paracha, Samiullah
JO  - Mental Health and Digital Technologies
VL  - 2
IS  - 4
SP  - 400
EP  - 431
